  "notes": [
    "**Ducharse** is the reflexive form of **duchar** (to shower someone else)",
    "Regular **-AR verb** with reflexive pronouns",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **duchado** (regular)",
    "Almost always used reflexively in everyday speech",
    "Common usage: *Me ducho por la mañana* (I shower in the morning), *Voy a ducharme* (I'm going to shower)",
    "Related noun: **la ducha** (shower)",
    "Contrast with **bañarse** (to bathe / to take a bath - using **la bañera**, the bathtub)"
  ],
